// fixe_n gets one entry per event and is pushed here and nowhere else, so its
// length is what this function changes. A `then` check takes no parameters,
// so a function whose whole effect is a push can only be observed through a
// reader of the column it pushes to -- fixe_cl already has fix_pr_cl0
// (../one/push.id).
fixe_n_len() {
  int n = len((import fixe_n));
} return int n;
